# Catch-All Safety Rules

> **CRITICAL:** Rules in `global-core.mdc` ALWAYS take precedence over these instructions.

## 🛡️ General Code Safety
1. **Fallback Validation:** Any file not matching a specific domain rule (e.g., UI, SDLC) falls into this category. The agent MUST NOT assume relaxed security standards.
2. **Minimal Edit Policy:** When modifying arbitrary files, the agent MUST adhere to the principle of least privilege. Do not reformat or clean up unrelated code.
3. **No Unknown Binaries:** Do not execute or modify unknown binary files or shell scripts without explicit user permission.
